## 其他重要性能指标

除了 Core Web Vitals，以下指标在性能分析中同样不可或缺：

| 指标 | 全称                   | 含义                   | 目标值  |
| ---- | ---------------------- | ---------------------- | ------- |
| TTFB | Time to First Byte     | 接收到第一个字节的时间 | < 800ms |
| FCP  | First Contentful Paint | 第一次绘制有意义内容   | < 1.8s  |
| TBT  | Total Blocking Time    | 主线程阻塞总时间       | < 200ms |
| TTI  | Time to Interactive    | 页面完全可交互的时间   | < 3.8s  |
| SI   | Speed Index            | 内容可视化填充速度     | < 3.4s  |

```typescript
const navigationEntry = performance.getEntriesByType('navigation')[0] as PerformanceNavigationTiming;

const metrics = {
  ttfb: navigationEntry.responseStart - navigationEntry.requestStart,
  domContentLoaded: navigationEntry.domContentLoadedEventEnd - navigationEntry.startTime,
  loadComplete: navigationEntry.loadEventEnd - navigationEntry.startTime,
  domInteractive: navigationEntry.domInteractive - navigationEntry.startTime,
  dnsLookup: navigationEntry.domainLookupEnd - navigationEntry.domainLookupStart,
  tcpConnect: navigationEntry.connectEnd - navigationEntry.connectStart,
  tlsNegotiation: navigationEntry.requestStart - navigationEntry.secureConnectionStart,
};

console.table(metrics);
```

